5,Sepik masks | Sepik River masks | sell | value | appraisal,https://www.new-guinea-tribal-arts.com/sepik-masks/,"Some Sepik masks are to wear and others for display. Some small masks are to empower “decorate” sacred flutes, the front of canoes, the HausMan, as lucky amulets and even yams.",Murik,Ramu-Lower Sepik
6,MythMagic - | | Garamut drum,https://digital.nga.gov.au/archive/exhibition/mythmagic/default.cfm?irn=211455&bioartistirn=211455&mystartrow=61&realstartrow=61&mnuid=srch&viewid=2.html,Garamut drums are iconic musical instruments from the Sepik/Ramu river region. They are carved from a tree trunk hollowed out via the narrow slit along the top to create the resonating chamber.,Murik,Ramu-Lower Sepik
